   {
    "primary": {
     "body_text": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "The Aalto Design system introduces design tokens and UI elements used in Aalto's digital platforms. It ensures that your designs align seamlessly with the brand identity and customer experience strategy, creating a cohesive user experience across all digital touchpoints. Additionally, the Brand section offers access to the design principles and identity elements of Aalto. ",
       "spans": [
        {
         "start": 290,
         "end": 303,
         "type": "hyperlink",
         "data": {
          "id": "ZlbS8REAACUAd72o",
          "type": "design_system_content",
          "tags": [
           "identity"
          ],
          "lang": "en-eu",
          "slug": "brand",
          "first_publication_date": "2024-05-29T07:03:27+0000",
          "last_publication_date": "2025-08-20T14:39:52+0000",
          "uid": "_brand",
          "link_type": "Document",
          "isBroken": false
         }
        }
       ],
       "direction": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "The design system provides pre-designed and pre-approved components that can be easily reused. By leveraging these building blocks, you can swiftly assemble interfaces.",
